<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Choice to proceed with rights offer.</title>
<headline>Choice to proceed with rights offer.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Choice Holdings Ltd said on Monday it would proceed with a rights offer of not less than 100 million rand in order to recapitalise the company.</p>
<p>The group said documentation in regard to the proposed offer was being prepared and shareholders would be advised of full details in due course. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>- Johannesburg newsroom +2711 482-1003</p>
